<title>USA: TransTechnology buys 100,000 shares.</title>
<headline>TransTechnology buys 100,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransTechnology Corp said on Friday that it purchased 100,000 shares of its common stock from a private estate at $16.25 per share.</p>
<p>An additional 308,875 shares were purchased from this estate at the same price by several institutional investors, the company said.</p>
<p>TransTechnology shares closed at 18, up 1/4.</p>
<p>Funds for the company's transaction were provided by its existing line of credit, TransTechnology said. The company made this transaction under a special authorization by its board of directors.</p>
<p>The company has approximately five million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
